{meta title='Powers, fractions and roots', about='A caret raises, an underscore lowers, a slash makes a fraction - the brackets around its parts are taken off - and sqrt and root draw the radical.'/}
<p>{math 'x^2 + y^2 = r^2'/} &middot; {math 'a_1, a_2, ..., a_n'/} &middot; {math 'e^(i pi) + 1 = 0'/}</p>
{math display='block'}x = (-b +- sqrt(b^2 - 4ac))/(2a){/math}
{math display='block'}root(3)(8) = 2, quad 1/2 + 1/3 = 5/6, quad (a+b)/(c+d){/math}
